rocesses:\r\n`maa startup Official --account-name account-a --profile mumu --batch`,\r\n`maa run maa-daily-business --profile mumu --batch`, then the same startup and shared\r\nbusiness task for account-b. Wait for each process and stop after any failure. The startup\r\nresults contain the identity evidence for the selected account. Do not claim the batch is\r\ncomplete until both startup processes and both business-task processes succeed.\r\n\n</skill>",
